  "description": "Becoming stepbrothers was supposed to be the hardest part of their parents’ romance. But when alpha Kim Yeong-Han steps in to nurse the troublesome beta Kim Min-Jae, an unexpected medical emergency shatters their lives. Min-Jae suddenly manifests as an omega, his raging heat obliterating his reason and throwing him directly into Yeong-Han’s arms. Yeong-Han tries to flee, but the thick scent of pheromones traps him instantly. Unable to resist the biology pulling them together, the two yield to temptation, leaving them with a secret that could ruin everything.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
